Abstract = {The proliferation of MOOCs has led to an issue of heterogeneity of data
   schemas and a problem of interoperability between different MOOC
   providers. The goal of this research paper is to propose a unified data
   model that serves as a basis for the design and implementation of a
   Linked Data repository. In order to achieve this goal, on the one hand,
