   Yu, Ellen; Acharya, Prabha; Jaramillo, Justin; Kientz, Sue; Hauksson, Egill, CALTECH, Seismol Lab, 1200 E Calif Blvd,MS 252-21, Pasadena, CA 91125 USA.
