Pages = {593-599},
Abstract = {According to the mineral properties management and resource evaluation
   demands of oil companies, based on the spatial information of oil and
   gas resources, combined with information analysis technologies, we
   optimised the oil and gas resources management system. and established a
   spatial information database with management platform. Using a web-GIS
   spatial database system, we achieved intelligent visual oil and gas
   resources mineral properties information management through spatial
   information service, oil and gas resources spatial analysis software and
   multiple auxiliary tools. Our spatial information database system
   utilises a four-layer architecture of `data information management'.
   `data information service', `spatial database application' and
   `multi-terminal comprehensive display', provides a variety of functions,
   including image element inspection, dynamic and static data information
   query and download, projection coordinate system conversion. spatial
   analysis, multi-dimensional statistical analysis, map service, etc. By
   applying GIS technology to oil companies' management of mineral
   properties, we have accomplished the integrative and comprehensive
   processing and analysis of spatial data and various geological and
   geographical data. While managing massive amounts of valuable
