   Space Intelligent Development and Utilization Forum (ICHCE), Xian,
   PEOPLES R CHINA, NOV 25-27, 2022},
Organization = {IEEE},
Abstract = {In order to verify the intelligent transportation system more directly,
   efficiently and comprehensively, this paper aims at the simulation and
   verification of the intelligent transportation system, and designs an
   intelligent transportation simulation and verification platform based on
   the hardware of intelligent minivan, simulation sand table, cloud
   monitoring platform, and millimeter class high-precision indoor
   positioning technology, multi-sensor fusion technology, and hardware in
   the loop simulation technology. At the same time, the multi vehicle
   formation control algorithm of the leader follower is applied to build
   the multi vehicle formation model, and the test verification is carried
   out on the simulation platform. The verification shows that the hardware
   in the loop simulation platform can effectively verify and quickly
   verify relevant algorithms. Compared with the traditional software
   simulation, the intelligent transportation verification platform based
   on hardware in the loop simulation technology has outstanding
   performance in model building, result analysis and effect display, and
   the simulation results are more accurate.},
