   Engineers},
Abstract = {Challenge of grid frequency quality degradation under high-penetration
   new energy grid integration is firstly addressed, and then the grid
   frequency support control strategy based on voltage source grid-forming
   energy storage as the regulating hardware unit is proposed in this
   paper. Secondly, based on virtual synchronous generator (VSG)
   technology, the existing grid-following energy storage converter control
   loop of Qingfengling Teaching Power Plant, is retrofitted to a
   grid-forming type. By gradually shutting down existing generator sets
   and integrating real photovoltaic and wind turbine generator sets to
   simulate a new energy low-inertia power system, the strategy is finally
   validated in operation in Qingfengling Teaching Power Plant, in an
   independent system. It could be summarized that after implementing the
