Abstract = {In this paper, it is focused on the electromechanical transient
   simulation model and parameters verification of battery energy storage
   system under the condition of grid-integration. Based on the comparison
   between measure curve and simulation cure, the verification method and
   steps are proposed including: model simulation, experimental test and
   model evaluation, etc., and an actual case is analyzed to verify the
   validity of the method. Research shows that as an important flexible
   source, the accuracy of simulation model parameters is particularly
   important for dispatching and operation control of battery energy
   storage system. The abovementioned verification method has important
   practical needs and engineering application value for grid-integration
   simulation decision of battery energy storage system.},
