Abstract = {With the wide application of shield machine in underground engineering,
   the safety and efficiency of hob changing operation become the focus of
   attention. In this paper, a Unity-based virtual simulation verification
   platform is proposed and applied to shield machine hobbing knife
   changing robot. The platform provides strong support for the research
   and application of shield machine tool changing robot by reproducing the
   shield machine hobbing tool changing environment, verifying the
   real-time collision distance of the robotic arm, optimizing the data
