   Leidos; Natl Ocean \& Atmospher Adm; Schmidt Ocean Inst},
Abstract = {The offshore platform consists of a large number of tubular structures
   which may be damaged by the impact of visiting ships and dropped objects
   during service.In this paper, the mechanical response of thin-walled
   circular steel tubes under lateral load fixed at both ends were mainly
   investigated. Firstly, the numerical simulation was performed by the
   commercial FEA software ABAQUS, and then the simulation results were
   verified by quasi-static experiments. In the end, the effect of the tube
   length, the indenter shape and the impact position on the mechanical
   response of tubular members were discussed.},
