   Bowen, L (Corresponding Author), Tsinghua Univ, Safety Minist Educ, Beijing, Peoples R China.
   Bowen, Li; Zhe, Dong; Di, Jiang, Inst Nucl \& New Energy Technol, Collaborat Innovat Ctr, Adv Nucl Energy Technol China, Key Lab Adv Reactor Engn, Beijing, Peoples R China.
